#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:18
#: 8979ea8462a34568a5cff039b3c14586
msgid "Connecting to the AutoPilot"
msgstr "连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:20
#: 6d3cdd12d7574b46a6e73347d213f25f
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The diagram below shows the sensor output pins and a conveniently colour-"
"coded cable (normally included or `see spec here "
"<http://documents.lightware.co.za/LW%20000_135%20-%20Main%20cable%20type%201%20assembly%20-%20Rev%200.pdf>`__)"
" which is used to connect to the autopilot. :ref:`Serial <sf10-serial-"
"connection>`, :ref:`I2C <sf10-i2c-connection>` and :ref:`Analog "
"<sf10-analog-connection>` connections are possible but we recommended using "
":ref:`Serial <sf10-serial-connection>` if possible especially if using "
"cables that are 30cm or longer."
msgstr ""
"下图显示传感器输出引脚和方便识别的彩色线缆（通常包含在内或 `查看规格 "
"<http://documents.lightware.co.za/LW%20000_135%20-%20Main%20cable%20type%201%20assembly%20-%20Rev%200.pdf>`__`），用于连接到飞控。:ref:`串口"
" <sf10-serial-connection>`、:ref:`I2C <sf10-i2c-connection>` 和 :ref:`模拟 "
"<sf10-analog-connection>` 连接均可，但建议尽量使用 :ref:`串口 <sf10-serial-"
"connection>`，尤其是使用 30cm 或更长线缆时。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:24
#: 92151021b75248c18a73316d69b71b42
msgid "The serial connection is recommended when using longer cables"
msgstr "使用较长线缆时推荐使用串口连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:28
#: 50c37d1c1b4446059a982f93e7bbeaf7
msgid "SF10 Rangefinder: Output Pins"
msgstr "SF10 测距仪：输出引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:33
#: 10d92e53805744d381c9e7abf61fcbdd
msgid "Main cable for SF10 Rangefinder"
msgstr "SF10 测距仪主线缆"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:38
#: 05697e1d217646bcb0eb438abab5616e
msgid "Serial connection"
msgstr "串口连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:40
#: 8d62cd4c78744b8f87f918e502b1cb31
msgid ""
"For a serial connection you can use any spare UART. Connect the RX line of "
"the UART to the TX line of the Lidar, and the TX line of the UART to the RX "
"line of the Lidar. Also connect the GND and 5V lines. You do not need flow "
"control pins."
msgstr ""
"对于串口连接，可使用任何空闲的 UART。将 UART 的 RX 线连接到激光雷达的 TX 线，将 UART 的 TX 线连接到激光雷达的 RX "
"线，同时连接 GND 和 5V 线。不需要流控引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:45
#: 75d98763d6d2467ab0a64e4169aac534
msgid "The diagram below shows how to connect to SERIAL4."
msgstr "下图显示了如何连接到 SERIAL4。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:50
#: d7bd54a1a6354fc19e9844aaca959f1f
msgid "Pixhawk and SF10Rangefinder: Serial Connection (SERIAL4)"
msgstr "Pixhawk 与 SF10 测距仪：串口连接（SERIAL4）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:52
#: 2c94a3aac8cf4b19b93c5bf15148b79e
msgid ""
"You then need to setup the serial port and rangefinder parameters. If you "
"have used the SERIAL4/5 port on the Pixhawk then you would set the following"
" parameters in the case of the first rangefinder(this is done in the "
"*Mission Planner* **Config/Tuning \\| Full Parameter List** page):"
msgstr ""
"然后需要设置串口和测距仪参数。如果使用 Pixhawk 上的 SERIAL4/5 端口，对于第一个测距仪应设置以下参数（在 *Mission "
"Planner* **配置/调参 \\| 完整参数列表**页面进行）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:57
#: 9b744de99b62477da2c10f3ad53380b1
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 9 (Lidar)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 9（激光雷达）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:58
#: 5866460a145e4796962813908416fc9f
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD <SERIAL4_BAUD>` = 115 (115200 baud)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD <SERIAL4_BAUD>` = 115（115200 波特率）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:59
#: c6e88099f05b46dd9fa174243d1e2541
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 8 (LightWareSerial)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 8（LightWareSerial）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:60
#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:87
#: 5673970f875b4dcda09ddffc03c0f5f6 70dafe1edf084c34be922f04a27eeb6f
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_SCALING <RNGFND1_SCALING>` = 1"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_SCALING <RNGFND1_SCALING>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:61
#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:88
#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:126
#: 0f7a923744c84ebd881535c20fe9a8fa 907524ed109244a9ab6d422ec4a99031
#: 98345f702e6349bd998191be0fb58ad5
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.05"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.05"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:62
#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:89
#: 0d42925c06344fdea14d9cf03e32e52d 2ae8d66fc323461a9fb499f509e3ced8
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = **25** (for SF10A), **50** (for SF10B), "
"**100** (for SF10C) or **120** (for SF11C).  *This is the distance in meters"
" that the rangefinder can reliably read. The value depends on the model of "
"the lidar.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = "
"**25**（SF10A）、**50**（SF10B）、**100**（SF10C）或 "
"**120**（SF11C）。*这是测距仪可以可靠读取的距离（米）。具体值取决于激光雷达型号。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:63
#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:90
#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:128
#: 7da619c3737c4f5ba1ed33021531abcc 836aae63c8ee4157b3483a738fcfd2f7
#: dc6b604642b14a4ab6b5c6d2d4e25ffd
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 *or more accurately the "
"distance in metres from the range finder to the ground when the vehicle is "
"landed.  This value depends on how you have mounted the rangefinder.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 "
"*或更精确地，飞行器降落时测距仪到地面的距离（米）。该值取决于测距仪的安装方式。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:65
#: 6d2a3906322a47c6856de988c75f8ce7
msgid ""
"If you instead were using the Telem2 port on the Pixhawk then you would set "
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9, and :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD "
"<SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115"
msgstr ""
"如果改用 Pixhawk 的 Telem2 端口，则应设置 :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = "
"9，以及 :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:67
#: 817295af07c6469882d375102a667557
msgid ""
"Lightware lidars manufactured before May 2018 shipped with a default baud "
"rate of 19200. If your device was produced before this date, you will need "
"to set the baud rate to 19200 (Parameter value 19). Alternatively, you may "
"reconfigure your lightware device to use a baudrate of 115200 using the "
"Lightware Terminal application and use the settings above."
msgstr ""
"2018 年 5 月前生产的 Lightware 激光雷达出厂默认波特率为 19200。如果您的设备在此日期前生产，则需要将波特率设置为 "
"19200（参数值 19）。或者，您可以使用 Lightware Terminal 应用程序将 Lightware 设备重新配置为 115200 "
"波特率，然后使用上述设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:72
#: 52499adb47ff467ebf675b86d08685dc
msgid "I2C connection"
msgstr "I2C 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:74
#: f86a26979c684bb7bd758ee7930ae141
msgid ""
"Connect the SDA line of the Lidar to the SDA line of the I2C port on the "
"Pixhawk, and the SCL line of the Lidar to the SCL line of the I2C port. Also"
" connect the GND and 5V lines."
msgstr ""
"将激光雷达的 SDA 线连接到 Pixhawk I2C 端口的 SDA 线，将激光雷达的 SCL 线连接到 I2C 端口的 SCL 线，同时连接 GND"
" 和 5V 线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:79
#: b9eb1bb608e64a57a0aeeb0baba3f075
msgid "Pixhawk and SF10 Rangefinder: I2CConnection"
msgstr "Pixhawk 与 SF10 测距仪：I2C 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:81
#: 14d810bacb0e4052acffe9cc3d0ea313
msgid ""
"You then need to configure the rangefinder parameters as shown below (this "
"is done in the *Mission Planner* **Config/Tuning \\| Full Parameter List** "
"page):"
msgstr "然后需要按如下所示配置测距仪参数（在 *Mission Planner* **配置/调参 \\| 完整参数列表**页面进行）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:85
#: 60c099d694c94562b82086ac7575d3c6
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 7 (LightWareI2C)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 7（LightWareI2C）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:86
#: 932270ad63b94a9b864fcdb0afbeeff7
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_ADDR <RNGFND1_ADDR>` = 102 (I2C Address of lidar in decimal)."
"  *Please note that this setting is in decimal and not hexadecimal as shown "
"in the lidar settings screen. The default address is 0x66 which is 102 in "
"decimal.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_ADDR <RNGFND1_ADDR>` = 102（十进制的激光雷达 I2C "
"地址）。*请注意该设置为十进制，而非激光雷达设置界面中显示的十六进制。默认地址为 0x66，即十进制 102。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:92
#: e40789470f4f4a22a50f28770afdd285
msgid ""
"It may be necessary to enable the sensor's \"I2C compatibility mode "
"(Pixhawk)\".  This can be done by connecting the lidar to your PC using a "
"USB cable, then download `Lightware Studio "
"<https://lightwarelidar.com/pages/lightware-studio>`__, connect and check "
"the checkbox shown below"
msgstr ""
"可能需要启用传感器的 「I2C 兼容模式（Pixhawk）」。方法是将激光雷达通过 USB 线缆连接到电脑，然后下载 `Lightware Studio"
" <https://lightwarelidar.com/pages/lightware-studio>`__，连接后勾选下图所示的复选框"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:100
#: 73315a820fbd45a1897ea295f9b8fbec
msgid ""
"The default I2C address was 85 (0x55 in hexadecimal) on older LightWare "
"rangefinders. This was changed to prevent conflict with another device on "
"ArduPilot. Please check your rangefinder system settings to determine what "
"your I2C address is."
msgstr ""
"旧版 LightWare 测距仪的默认 I2C 地址为 85（十六进制 0x55）。该地址已被修改，以避免与 ArduPilot "
"上的其他设备冲突。请检查您的测距仪系统设置以确认 I2C 地址。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:107
#: f8baec035ba74bba895843d2581a45dc
msgid "Analog connection"
msgstr "模拟连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:109
#: 320e51af26154256860aee1f48c8a7ed
msgid ""
"The SF10's Analog Out pin (5) should be connected to the Pixhawk's 3.3V ADC "
"(analog to digital converter).  The Pixhawk will provide the regulated 5V "
"power supply needed by the sensor using the 5V and GND pins of the ADC "
"connector."
msgstr ""
"SF10 的模拟输出引脚（5）应连接到 Pixhawk 的 3.3V ADC（模数转换器）。Pixhawk 将通过 ADC 连接器的 5V 和 GND "
"引脚为传感器提供所需的稳压 5V 供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:117
#: 3f394e523daf4ea6b3d53b56ae2a4a39
msgid "Pixhawk and SF10 Rangefinder:Analog Connection"
msgstr "Pixhawk 与 SF10 测距仪：模拟连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:119
#: f7bc4ffb4a194e5785241dd72b2c23dc
msgid ""
"You then need to setup the ADC and rangefinder parameters as shown below "
"(this is done in the *Mission Planner* **Config/Tuning \\| Full Parameter "
"List** page):"
msgstr "然后需要按如下所示设置 ADC 和测距仪参数（在 *Mission Planner* **配置/调参 \\| 完整参数列表**页面进行）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:123
#: 30b69a8e35f14b63b1abc3c1521ce67b
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 1 (Analog)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 1（模拟）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:124
#: 166db38bb91546d88a12a529f2771c7c
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_PIN <RNGFND1_PIN>` = 14 (2nd pin of 3.3V ADC connector)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_PIN <RNGFND1_PIN>` = 14（3.3V ADC 连接器第 2 引脚）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:125
#: 83653e2094234f95a64fbc0e7523a154
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_SCALING <RNGFND1_SCALING>` = **9.76** (for SF10A), **19.531** "
"(for SF10B), **39.06** (for SF10C), **46.87** (for SF11C)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_SCALING <RNGFND1_SCALING>` = "
"**9.76**（SF10A）、**19.531**（SF10B）、**39.06**（SF10C）、**46.87**（SF11C）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:127
#: 0a85202b4edf4cdf8008ec62891cdb8f
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = **20** (for SF10A), **45** (for SF10B), "
"**95** (for SF10C) or **115** (for SF11C).  *This is the distance in meters "
"that the rangefinder can reliably read. The value depends on the model of "
"the lidar.  Note the range is 5m less than using Serial or I2C protocols so "
"that out-of-range can be reliably detected*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = "
"**20**（SF10A）、**45**（SF10B）、**95**（SF10C）或 "
"**115**（SF11C）。*这是测距仪可以可靠读取的距离（米）。具体值取决于激光雷达型号。注意，使用模拟协议时比串口或 I2C 协议量程少 "
"5m，以便可靠检测超量程情况*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:130
#: a5186b155c1c4553bde26153cbeac125
msgid ""
"The :ref:`RNGFND1_SCALING <RNGFND1_SCALING>` value depends on the voltage on"
" the rangefinders output pin at the maximum range. By default the SF10/B "
"will output 2.56V at 50m, so the scaling factor is 50m / 2.56v ≈ 19.53 (the "
"analog distance range for each of the rangefinder variants can be found in "
"the `SF10 Manual "
"<http://documents.lightware.co.za/SF10%20-%20Laser%20Altimeter%20Manual%20-%20Rev%2011.pdf>`__)."
" The manual explains how you can confirm and change the maximum output "
"range/voltage."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_SCALING <RNGFND1_SCALING>` 的值取决于测距仪输出引脚在最大测距时的电压。默认情况下，SF10/B "
"在 50m 时输出 2.56V，因此缩放系数为 50m / 2.56V ≈ 19.53（每种测距仪型号的模拟距离范围可在 `SF10 手册 "
"<http://documents.lightware.co.za/SF10%20-%20Laser%20Altimeter%20Manual%20-%20Rev%2011.pdf>`__"
" 中找到）。手册说明了如何确认和更改最大输出范围/电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:136
#: ba0faa7dda384c949d8987f8422419ad
msgid ""
"We highly recommend that you tune the ``RNGFND1_SCALING`` value by comparing"
" the output against a known distance."
msgstr "强烈建议通过与已知距离进行对比，来校准 ``RNGFND1_SCALING`` 值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:140
#: acb62b02d10246dea69ddce205d81c14
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:142
#: 66cba8bbb433459fabbdac35cd6c852b
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look closely for \"rangefinder1\"."
msgstr "传感器读取的距离可在 Mission Planner 飞行数据界面的状态标签页中查看。请注意查找 「rangefinder1」。"
